hint: Update `total += nums[right] - nums[right - k]`, then append `total / k`.
hint: n items give n − k + 1 averages.
right: One update and one division per window: O(n), where summing each window again would be O(n × k).
wrong: Keep the window's total. After the first window, each slide adds the entering item, subtracts the leaving one, and appends the new total divided by k.

